OK    VUS (geometric) is invariant to within its grid resolution   max |dVUS| = 1.45e-06
OK    arc elasticities shift by exactly the predicted amount   max error = 1.92e-14

  The gauge moved the arc elasticities by up to 2.846 while moving VUS by
  0.0e+00.  That is the point: the transformation VUS cannot see is
  exactly the one that sets the answer.  VUS constrains the ranking; the LEVEL is fixed
  entirely by calibration -- which, in a randomised price test, is what randomisation
  buys you for free.
